{"nodeId":"method:probability-computer-simulation","contents":[{"id":"lesson-content:U17:birthday-simulation","nodeId":"method:probability-computer-simulation","proposedNodeId":"proposal:book-5:probability-computer-simulation","kind":"method_application","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"概率计算机模拟：生日事件","scope":"用随机函数和统计模拟生日事件，区别于随机数抽样选人。","blocks":[{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"源文明确给“解答与计算机模拟方法参考”，以GeoGebra为例，使用随机函数和统计完成计算机模拟。【编辑明确模型】忽略闰日，365天生日等可能且不同人独立；每轮重新生成全组数据，以“至少存在一对生日相同”为一次成功事件，重复轮数作分母。此为模型模拟，不声称现实生日严格均匀。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:U17:birthday-simulation:b0"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"在表格区按源文random(1,365)生成1至365的随机数，代表一年中的日期；拖拽生成多个人的日期数据。函数名保留为源软件示例，未宣称已验证当前软件语法。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:U17:birthday-simulation:b1"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"生成茎叶图，检查是否出现至少两人同一天生日；多次重新计算，形成用于验证生日悖论的数据。原截图与茎叶图保留在第19页。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:U17:birthday-simulation:b2"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"指定生日变式：先随机指定一个不大于365的正整数，再产生一组随机数；利用茎叶图查该指定数是否出现，重复试验后计算比例。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:U17:birthday-simulation:b3"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"condition","type":"text","value":"理论计算与画图先取$n=15,16,\\ldots,60$，模拟时另选特定$n$；指定生日变式先取$m=200,201,\\ldots,2200$计算概率并画图，再选特定$m$模拟。","evidenceIds":["ev:book5:U17:birthday-simulation:b4"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction"}],"contentOrigin":"source_based_reconstruction","wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","titleWordingStatus":"editorial_normalized_title","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"按本题实际任务和现有节点语义匹配；不从共用运算推定先修。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book5:U17:birthday-simulation:b0","sourceId":"U17","sourceSha256":"ff41e1297a5bfbce8879a537e793d14df0d9b3e2d2a149c9a1bc1443a9869b9f","locator":{"headingPath":["概率计算机模拟：生日事件"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":338,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":